{"id":"cuarto","lemma":"cuarto","pos":"noun","rank":433,"glosses":["fourth (in a series)","quarter-hour (one of four equal divisions of an hour)","watch (one of the four approximately equal divisions of the night, especially for shifts of watchmen)"],"ipa":"/ˈkwaɾto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuartos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cuarto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo necesito un cuarto.","en":"I need a room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440349"},{"text":"Tres medios son seis cuartos.","en":"Three halves is six quarters.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819895"},{"text":"Este es nuestro cuarto.","en":"This is our room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799446"},{"text":"Esta casa tiene dos cuartos de baño.","en":"This house has two bathrooms."},{"text":"Este cuarto es caluroso.","en":"This room is hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443408"}]}